## Interface: 16001
## Title: Top Ramen Farm
## Notes: /trfarm opens the farm tracker. Press Start farming, loot things, and it tallies what you've made: vendor value vs. selling smart on the auction house. Toggle it off when you're done. At a merchant, the Vendor items button sells the items you ticked.
